# ArcGIS Pro project cruft / lock files - not needed in version control
*.sr.lock
*.aprx.lock
*.gdb/
*.aprx.bak
.DS_Store

# Shapefile exports are ArcGIS-review-only copies of the canonical GeoJSON
# (see README "Standard schema") - regenerable, and the sandbox's inability to
# overwrite files means these accumulate as _v2/_v3/etc. duplicates. Don't
# version-control them; GeoJSON is the source of truth.
*.shp
*.shx
*.dbf
*.cpg
*.prj

# Orphaned georeferencing aid for the RFWSD PDF - no longer needed since
# RFWSD's real boundary came from Colorado DOLA instead (7/28/26).
data/raw/rfwsd_service_area_2007.png*

# Deprecated placeholder from an earlier styling exploration
data/reference/_category_palette_preview.*
